exports[`Notice template renderers > renders gambling-agc-new 1`] = `
"GAMBLING ACT 2005, SCHEDULE 9
APPLICATION FOR A NEW ADULT GAMING CENTRE PREMISES LICENCE

Sample Gaming Ltd has applied to Sample Licensing Authority for an Adult Gaming Centre premises licence at Sample Betting Shop, 12 Market Street, Sampleton LS1 1AA. Proposed activities: Betting, Gaming machines (Category B2, B3, C, D). Proposed hours: Mon–Sun 09:00–22:00.

Any representations must relate to one or more of the licensing objectives under the Gambling Act 2005: (a) preventing gambling from being a source of crime or disorder, being associated with crime or disorder, or being used to support crime; (b) ensuring that gambling is conducted in a fair and open way; (c) protecting children and other vulnerable persons from being harmed or exploited by gambling.

The application can be inspected at Licensing Authority, Town Hall, Sampleton LS1 2BB during Mon–Fri, 9am–5pm. Any representations must be made in writing to Sample Licensing Authority at Licensing Authority, Town Hall, Sampleton LS1 2BB or licensing@sample.gov.uk by 2026-02-18."
`;

