exports[`Notice template renderers > renders gvol-new 1`] = `
"GOODS VEHICLE (OPERATOR'S) LICENCE

Sample Haulage Ltd trading as Sample Logistics of Logistics House, Manchester M1 1AA is applying for a Standard National operator's licence in the North Western Traffic Area.

Proposed operating centre: Unit 5 Industrial Estate, Manchester M1 1AA.
Authorisation: 6 goods vehicles and 4 trailers.

Owners or occupiers of land (including buildings) near the operating centre who believe that their use or enjoyment of that land would be affected may make representations to the Traffic Commissioner at Suite 4, Stone Cross Place, Stone Cross Lane North, Golborne, Warrington WA3 2SH by 2026-02-16.

Representations must be made in writing. Representors must at the same time send a copy to the applicant at the address given above."
`;

