Proposed hours: Alcohol: Mon–Sun 11:00–23:00, Live Music: Fri–Sat 20:00–23:30, Late Night Refreshment: Fri–Sat 23:00–00:30. Opening hours: Mon–Thu 10:00–23:30, Fri–Sat 10:00–00:30, Sun 11:00–22:30.

