exports[`Notice template renderers > renders planning-conservation 1`] = `
"PLANNING (LISTED BUILDINGS AND CONSERVATION AREAS) ACT 1990
APPLICATION REFERENCE: SCC/2025/1234 — CONSERVATION AREA

Sample Developments Ltd has applied to Sample City Council for planning permission at Riverside Way, Sample City EC1A 1BB described as: Construction of a mixed-use development comprising 80 dwellings, retail space, and public realm improvements..

This application affects a conservation area and has been notified to relevant heritage bodies and statutory consultees as required by the Planning (Listed Buildings and Conservation Areas) Act 1990.

Details can be viewed at Civic Offices, Sample City EC1A 2CC or online at https://planning.sample.gov.uk/register. Comments must be submitted via the online portal to Sample City Council at Planning Department, Civic Offices, Sample City EC1A 2CC / planning@sample.gov.uk / https://planning.sample.gov.uk/applications/123456 by 2026-02-16."
`;

